cording and checking the actual game: the recorder (record/saveRaw) just forwarded a named move to mcp__go__play and logged the raw response, inspect parsed the current board into groups, liberties, regions and area counts, and verify replayed the already-played moves to check legality and captures. The rest was reading and writing notes and memory files, and nothing looped over candidate moves or looked ahead.", "stop": false}}